1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,601
Degrees of comparison.

2
00:00:01,601 --> 00:00:09,570
One syllable takes er and est: tall, taller, tallest; double a final consonant: big, bigger.

3
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:12,304
Y becomes i: happy, happier.

4
00:00:12,304 --> 00:00:17,317
Two syllables or more take more and most: more beautiful.

5
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:28,789
And the irregulars: good, better, best; bad, worse, worst; far, farther or further; old, older or elder.

